abstract: "Self-hosted, non-custodial cryptocurrency payment gateway. Accept USDT/USDC on TRON TRC20, EVM chains, and SUI with zero gateway fees. Docker-based deployment with REST API, HMAC-signed webhooks, and real-time mempool transaction detection."
